        "contenuto_esteso": "Democratic strategist David Axelrod said Monday night that President Trump's reported outburst at Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu on a phone call earlier in the day was justified. Trump reportedly slammed Netanyahu over the prime minister’s plan to attack Hezbollah targets in southern Beirut, an escalation of the war in Lebanon that prompted Iran to..."
